# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/virtualization/
# (quick task 260829-vfi). Mirrors every sibling module manifest's own
# standing instruction (see modules/security/qmldir, modules/osd/qmldir):
# any .qml type added to this directory that is NOT declared below becomes
# unresolvable, with no load error — it simply reads `undefined` forever.
# qml-import-check enforces this. Any FUTURE type added here MUST be
# declared in the same commit that creates it.
#
# ── THE `singleton` KEYWORD IS LOAD-BEARING ───────────────────────────
# VirtualizationBackend carries `pragma Singleton` AND is marked
# `singleton` below. modules/qmldir's own header records why both are
# required, binary-verified in 12-06: without the qmldir keyword, a bare
# `VirtualizationBackend.vmState`-style access resolves to `undefined`
# forever and the object is never constructed. Removing either one is a
# silent, error-free failure.
module qs.modules.virtualization

singleton VirtualizationBackend 1.0 VirtualizationBackend.qml
